{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10297820","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10297820","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1029782001:1":{"text":"这里比祭典时的雪松镇还要更加喧闹，我都有些不适应了。","source_cn":"这里比祭典时的雪松镇还要更加喧闹，我都有些不适应了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A621EBB4CC25A4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029782002:1":{"text":"瓦丽卡，真的是你！我还以为认错人了呢！","source_cn":"瓦丽卡，真的是你！我还以为认错人了呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8264F97A8AE31F25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029782003:1":{"text":"嗯，我帮忙法拉莫尔运送货物，正好有闲，就在这里稍微逛逛。","source_cn":"嗯，我帮忙法拉莫尔运送货物，正好有闲，就在这里稍微逛逛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFCE20B4099B90E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029782004:1":{"text":"因为我能遮掩自己的外形，不至于因为亡灵之身引发外人的恐慌，所以罗德里戈先生也支持我出外。","source_cn":"因为我能遮掩自己的外形，不至于因为亡灵之身引发外人的恐...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x280E81D956558F2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029782005:1":{"text":"其他人目前还在雪松镇，我离开时，卡列琳娜倒是计划着出来采购呢。","source_cn":"其他人目前还在雪松镇，我离开时，卡列琳娜倒是计划着出来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1A9359E34874ACF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029782006:1":{"text":"毕竟要让大众熟悉亡灵还是任重而道远，现在这样已经不错了……","source_cn":"毕竟要让大众熟悉亡灵还是任重而道远，现在这样已经不错了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2BC4A555A053374","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029782007:1":{"text":"那么，你在这里买了什么好东西吗？","source_cn":"那么，你在这里买了什么好东西吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11FD7E6B38E847A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1029782008:1":{"text":"当然了，给每个人都带了礼物，我还遇到了一位蛮血的年轻朋友，为我推荐了适合的颜料。","source_cn":"当然了，给每个人都带了礼物，我还遇到了一位蛮血的年轻朋...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA45360B97672AD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1029782009:1":{"text":"那孩子很像伊戈尔，虽然外表成熟，但内心还是个小孩子——不过他可比伊戈尔要乖巧得多了。","source_cn":"那孩子很像伊戈尔，虽然外表成熟，但内心还是个小孩子——...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7C129C3BED27A46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1029782010:1":{"text":"那是噜噜，荒角沙漠的大画家！他画的画可好看了！","source_cn":"那是噜噜，荒角沙漠的大画家！他画的画可好看了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA181351CD90AE737","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13